    "group": "Slaanesh’s Chosen",
    "summary": "**EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER** units in your army may ignore modifiers (some or all) to their Move, **Advance rolls** and **Charge rolls**.\n\nYour **WARLORD**’s unit starts the battle as the Favoured Champions. Each turn, whichever player's it is, the first time an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER** unit of yours destroys an enemy unit, that **CHARACTER** unit takes over as Favoured Champions once all its attacks are resolved.\n\nModels in your Favoured Champions unit may re-roll their **[Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**.",
